    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Import, select No Environment, then Run entire collection in order (1 iteration, 300 ms delay). Requires Docker Compose and seeded demo accounts. Automatically creates demo records and pays the generated room bill. Repeatable with unique codes. Tariff setup branches automatically in Runner. Period is one day for a quick demo. Stop on HTTP failure. Tokens and IDs stay in collection variables; access_token points to the new student at the end."
  },
